- Add `test` and `test:watch` scripts.
- Ensure all BDD dependencies are correctly listed in `devDependencies`.

#### [NEW] [jest.config.js](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/jest.config.js)
